  "description": "The small town farmer life is all Gi-Tae has known his whole life. He’s never been into mystery, intrigue, or complications. But all of that appears in the form of his newly hired helper Hae-Un—who is absolutely useless at farming. But Hae-Un’s true talents lay somewhere else. Mainly in the bed…if only they could actually get into a bed, somehow.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
